     A**
     A* * * NEXT OPTICAL LIB CONTROL FILE
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     ** FILE CONTAINS 1 RECORD FOR EACH OPTICAL LIB ATTACHED TO ISERIES
     **   FILE SPECIFIES THE LAST USEABLE VOLUME ID ON THE CURRENT
     **   OPTICAL LIBRARY.  ONCE MAX IS REACHED ON THIS VOLID,
     **   THE NEXT LIB IS USED TO UPDATE THE SMOCP (CTL FILE)
     **   IF NO NEXT INFO IS FOUND, THERE IS NOT ANOTHER LIB.
     **   UPON INSTALL OF A NEW OPT LIB, THIS FILE IS MANUALLY UPDATED.
     ******************************************************************
     A*  REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(SCREFP)
     A          R PNO01                     TEXT('NXT OPT LIB CTL   -
     A                                      FILE(CURRENT VALUES)')
     A            NOOSYS         1A         TEXT('CURNT OPT SYSTEM ID         ')
     A            NOLIBN        10A         TEXT('CURNT OPT LIB NAME         ')
     A****
     A            NOVOLI         6A         TEXT('FRST USEABLE VOLID 4 NEW LIB')
     A            NONOSY         1A         TEXT('NEXT OPT SYSTEM ID         ')
     A            NONLIB        10A         TEXT('NEXT OPT LIB NAME         ')
     A            NOFULL         1A         TEXT('FULL LIBRARY')
     A            NOSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            NOUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            NOPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            NOTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            NODT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            NOIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('RECORD CREATED BY')
     A            NOIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
      *
